# Install artifacts. dist/server.js is a committed single-file bundle so installs need no build
# and no runtime node_modules for the JS deps (design §4.1). node_modules is only needed to
# (re)build/bundle or to install the @openai/codex CLI package (chain link 2).
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Build-time only: esbuild metafile consumed by the dynamic-require audit gate, not shipped.
dist/server.meta.json
